/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/node_modules/.pnpm/@earendil-works+pi-coding-agent@0.80.7_@modelcontextprotocol+sdk@1.29.0_zod@3.25.76__ws@8.21.1_zod@3.25.76/node_modules/@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent/docs/security.md:51:- review diffs and outputs before copying results back to trusted systems
