Two findings materially change the overlap analysis: `0.80.7` has a portable `AgentHarness` plus injectable session/storage and execution interfaces in `pi-agent-core`, while `pi-coding-agent` retains a separate Node/JSONL `SessionManager`; and pi explicitly ships no MCP client at all. I’m now mapping those native seams against boring-ui’s actual host modules so the deletion table names concrete replacement conditions.
